silm:instances_papers_03_silmaril_federation_chapters_flat_sections_02_mittens_anchor_concrete_anchor_mittens_instance silm:hasExample "In 'MittensInstanceNode', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, Mittens is the governed individual cat — the colimit apex of D_Mittens. In the taxonomy diagram, this is the leftmost instancenode. Mittens is NOT the taxon row, NOT the storage key, NOT the catalog trace. It is the individual cat whose vet records, storage packets, and graph assertions are the cocone legs.." .
